# Israel — UTI vs UMI (never blend)

**UTI** and **UMI** are two different Israel distributors (separate PRISM DBs, separate KPI rows, different parc/segment).

## IDS 2026

- The **IDS Israel** country pack is the **UMI dealer network** (files under `IDS_2026/Israel/`, ranking includes e.g. UMI Petach Tikva).
- **UTI did not participate** in that IDS round.
- When joining IDS Israel scores to PMS / GPS / KPI / genuine mix: use **UMI only**.

## Forbidden

- Averaging, blending, or “Israel = UTI+UMI” for any IDS-linked chart, correlation, Kaizen register, or footnote.
- Using UTI GPS/PMS as the DB context for an IDS Israel dealer.

## Allowed

- Analyse **UTI** on its own (GPS, PMS, SPA, meetings) — just not as the counterpart to IDS Israel.
- Show UTI and UMI as **two rows** side by side if a network Israel view is needed — never one blended number labelled “Israel” next to IDS.
